# ============================================
# Root .gitignore — monorepo (abroad + portfolio)
# ============================================
# Each app keeps its own .gitignore for app-specific rules.
# This file only covers workspace-level artifacts.

# Dependencies (in case a package is hoisted to root later)
/node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Next.js build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Test / coverage output
**/coverage/

# TypeScript incremental build info
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files — never commit secrets
# Covers .env, .env.local, .env.production, .env.development, .env.*.local, …
# The checked-in template is allowed back in explicitly.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor & OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Local tooling / caches
.eslintcache
.vercel/
*.pem
*.log

# Agent / assistant scratch files (keep deliberate docs, ignore transient output)
**/.tmp/

# Agent skill packs (installed via `npx skills add`; tooling, not app source)
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# BE
backend/node_modules/
backend/dist/

# BE — SQLite database files (recreated via `prisma db push`)
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal